  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of workers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO support to trade unions in Serbia has included the development of a mobile application where workers can record grievances.  The application is called My Labour Rights and informs about workers&#x2019; rights and allow workers to report violations directly to a trade union.  
This application requires updates to enhance easy access and reporting labour rights violations, both for trade union members and other workers. 
This effort will contribute to strengthen trade unions to effectively use grievance mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
